WEBVTT

00:09.944 --> 00:11.944
MkvDrama.me

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.478 --> 01:42.613
=Episode 18=
(If There Were Only One Rose in the World)

02:08.190 --> 02:09.710
I can't just leave right now.

02:37.991 --> 02:38.991
Are you still mad?

02:44.271 --> 02:45.351
Then go back and be mad.

02:45.751 --> 02:46.751
If it doesn't work,

02:47.991 --> 02:49.150
run two laps on the field.

03:01.030 --> 03:02.030
I'm leaving.

03:17.150 --> 03:18.150
Hold on.

03:21.791 --> 03:22.791
Give me the hair tie.

03:25.510 --> 03:26.510
What hair tie?

04:03.030 --> 04:04.070
Close the door.

04:42.871 --> 04:43.710
(I promised you.)

04:43.871 --> 04:46.150
(If I spend money on you,
I'll write an 8,000-word essay.)

04:46.590 --> 04:48.590
(I paid for the karaoke tonight.)

04:48.871 --> 04:49.550
(I'll only write)

04:49.751 --> 04:50.791
(hundreds of words.)

04:51.190 --> 04:52.190
(You take a look.)

04:58.630 --> 04:59.911
(During the summer vacation,)

04:59.991 --> 05:01.710
(I actually met your mom once.)

05:02.391 --> 05:03.751
(But I never told you.)

05:04.030 --> 05:05.030
(Don't worry.)

05:05.351 --> 05:07.030
(She didn't say anything harsh to me)

05:07.271 --> 05:08.550
(or throw money at me.)

05:09.070 --> 05:10.670
(But that's a pity.)

05:11.070 --> 05:12.311
(Your mom is a bit stingy.)

05:14.710 --> 05:17.030
(But from her words, I could feel)

05:17.110 --> 05:18.150
(she loves you very much.)

05:18.550 --> 05:20.230
(She cares about you.)

05:20.951 --> 05:23.911
(She kept saying she had a good son.)

05:28.550 --> 05:30.070
(Your mom also said)

05:30.150 --> 05:31.510
(we're in a relationship)

05:31.590 --> 05:32.911
(on spur of the moment.)

05:33.311 --> 05:34.070
(Rest assured.)

05:34.271 --> 05:35.831
(I immediately refuted her on this.)

05:36.311 --> 05:37.991
(Then she remained silent.)

05:40.710 --> 05:43.511
(But at that time,
we had known each other)

05:43.591 --> 05:45.030
(for only a month by then.)

05:46.968 --> 05:49.110
(It's easy to be impulsive
in early stage of love.)

05:49.510 --> 05:51.190
(Nobody can predict what will happen.)

05:51.630 --> 05:52.871
(So in the end,)

05:53.190 --> 05:55.110
(I never tried to persuade you to stay.)

05:59.751 --> 06:02.271
(Back then, I was afraid
that if I pushed you,)

06:02.351 --> 06:04.070
(you would fall out with your family.)

06:04.710 --> 06:06.271
(When you cooled down later)

06:06.550 --> 06:08.831
(and realized
I wasn't as good as you thought,)

06:09.471 --> 06:10.710
(you might feel regret.)

06:12.391 --> 06:13.630
(So at that time,)

06:13.871 --> 06:15.271
(I didn't dare to call you)

06:15.471 --> 06:16.791
(or say I missed you.)

06:29.230 --> 06:30.831
(I didn't want you to gamble for me.)

06:31.391 --> 06:33.230
(Nor did I want you
to be seen as ungrateful.)

06:36.150 --> 06:37.150
(Chen Luzhou.)

06:37.791 --> 06:38.791
(If I simply want)

06:38.871 --> 06:40.431
(to date you,)

06:41.070 --> 06:43.271
(I can make it sound more charming.)

06:44.471 --> 06:45.471
(I admit)

06:45.751 --> 06:46.751
(that's very romantic.)

06:47.590 --> 06:49.590
(But I want to go further with you.)

06:57.311 --> 06:58.431
(I always feel)

06:58.791 --> 06:59.591
(that love is not)

06:59.671 --> 07:01.710
(all about reckless impulse
and romance.)

07:02.391 --> 07:04.431
(Love should also make people brave)

07:04.791 --> 07:06.110
(and strong.)

07:08.590 --> 07:11.230
(Do you remember the exhibition
during the summer vacation?)

07:12.431 --> 07:13.951
(Actually, after we broke up,)

07:14.190 --> 07:15.190
(I went to see it.)

07:15.630 --> 07:17.590
(That sculptor has vividly expressed)

07:17.670 --> 07:20.431
(what the strongest love is.)

07:42.951 --> 07:43.950
(By this,)

07:44.030 --> 07:45.230
(I'd like to say something.)

07:46.311 --> 07:48.991
(If there were only one last rose
in the world,)

07:49.190 --> 07:51.430
(I would rush forward
and grab it for you)

07:51.510 --> 07:53.311
(even if I were aged 80
and in a wheelchair.)

07:54.791 --> 07:55.791
(After all,)

07:56.510 --> 07:58.150
(my boyfriend Shy Boy Chen)

07:58.510 --> 08:00.710
(is a romantic poet.)

08:00.894 --> 08:07.097
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

08:07.838 --> 08:11.416
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

08:11.678 --> 08:16.154
♪A brilliant scenery♪

08:16.574 --> 08:22.294
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

08:22.782 --> 08:26.289
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

08:27.134 --> 08:31.789
♪Drew a trajectory♪

08:32.702 --> 08:38.737
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

08:40.734 --> 08:46.632
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

09:16.631 --> 09:18.270
Your boyfriend Shy Boy Chen?

09:22.030 --> 09:23.671
So, am I now your boyfriend?

09:23.991 --> 09:26.270
Don't you deny that you're Shy Boy Chen?

09:28.958 --> 09:31.832
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

09:32.094 --> 09:36.002
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

09:37.150 --> 09:40.871
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

09:40.951 --> 09:43.030
Didn't you go back
to the dormitory to calm down?

09:43.430 --> 09:44.591
Why did you come back again?

09:47.551 --> 09:49.190
I think you know why.

09:51.390 --> 09:52.591
My mom didn't give you money.

09:53.270 --> 09:54.791
Were you quite sad about it?

09:55.631 --> 09:57.150
I didn't feel sad

09:57.270 --> 09:58.511
or disappointed.

09:59.190 --> 10:01.470
I just wondered
why she wasn't playing by the rules.

10:03.110 --> 10:04.270
I thought about what to say.

10:07.390 --> 10:08.390
What would you say?

10:09.310 --> 10:10.430
I would say,

10:10.791 --> 10:12.390
"I'm pregnant with Chen Luzhou's baby,"

10:13.430 --> 10:14.511
"and I'll have this child."

10:15.390 --> 10:18.111
"The money you gave me is not enough
for the child support"

10:18.191 --> 10:19.350
"and emotional injury."

10:19.551 --> 10:20.751
"Give me more, anyway."

10:21.551 --> 10:25.190
"When our child grows up,
and I don't spend it all,"

10:25.190 --> 10:26.470
"I'll return the rest to you."

10:28.470 --> 10:29.831
You love to tease me, huh?

10:31.230 --> 10:32.430
You're quite tolerant.

10:32.591 --> 10:33.951
Just because of what my mom said,

10:34.310 --> 10:36.070
you only called me once.

10:36.831 --> 10:37.951
Did you really miss me?

10:38.551 --> 10:40.030
Did you really miss me?

10:40.671 --> 10:41.311
If you did,

10:41.391 --> 10:42.831
why would you call me once?

10:42.951 --> 10:44.190
You said I was not good. I...

10:45.110 --> 10:46.511
What are you talking about?

10:54.190 --> 10:55.591
Why did you say those things

10:55.751 --> 10:57.030
after I left?

10:57.871 --> 10:59.270
Aren't you still angry?

11:06.791 --> 11:08.470
Your short essay is quite good.

11:15.430 --> 11:16.430
To be honest,

11:17.671 --> 11:18.751
did you like me

11:18.831 --> 11:20.110
when you first saw me?

11:22.631 --> 11:23.711
If I say no,

11:23.871 --> 11:25.190
you probably won't believe me.

11:26.591 --> 11:27.631
But truly, I didn't.

11:35.430 --> 11:37.390
Do you still remember our first meeting?

11:38.150 --> 11:40.270
Back then, you lived downstairs
from Tan Xu's house.

11:40.671 --> 11:41.552
Your mom scolded you,

11:41.552 --> 11:44.056
as you didn't do well on exams.
She wanted to send you abroad.

11:44.631 --> 11:45.391
At that time,

11:45.471 --> 11:46.911
I didn't dare to approach you.

11:47.551 --> 11:49.030
I was afraid you were like Tan Xu,

11:49.350 --> 11:51.110
blaming everything
for doing badly on exams.

11:52.190 --> 11:53.230
And when others do well,

11:53.310 --> 11:54.751
you would feel jealous.

11:56.911 --> 11:58.030
At that time, I thought

11:58.551 --> 12:00.871
18 or 19-year-old boys were dull.

12:01.711 --> 12:03.070
They can do nothing but the exams.

12:05.270 --> 12:06.551
So at that time,

12:06.951 --> 12:08.951
I rarely mentioned scores to you.

12:10.671 --> 12:11.991
But later, I discovered

12:13.551 --> 12:15.230
that not all 18 or 19-year-old boys

12:15.310 --> 12:16.551
are that dull.

12:19.110 --> 12:20.110
So,

12:20.430 --> 12:21.430
you are praising me?

12:21.551 --> 12:22.591
I'm indeed praising you.

12:27.831 --> 12:30.230
Tan Xu came to me and said

12:32.110 --> 12:34.430
the pressure of repeating the year
was too much for him.

12:34.911 --> 12:36.470
He wanted to be motivated in Huaguang.

12:37.390 --> 12:38.831
I didn't tell you

12:39.070 --> 12:40.150
as you didn't care about

12:40.230 --> 12:41.350
the matters of Jiang Yu.

12:41.991 --> 12:44.631
There's a big gap
between Tan Xu and Jiang Yu.

12:45.176 --> 12:46.791
Yangqi can't compare with Jiang Yu.

12:47.671 --> 12:48.831
I thought you didn't care.

12:50.310 --> 12:52.350
I think Zhu Yangqi is more handsome
than Jiang Yu.

12:52.551 --> 12:53.551
Really?

12:53.911 --> 12:54.632
I guess

12:54.712 --> 12:56.511
you think too highly of Zhu Yangqi.

13:01.470 --> 13:03.230
Previously, we didn't go steady.

13:03.871 --> 13:04.951
But now,

13:06.110 --> 13:07.951
if Tan Xu finds you again,
what will you say?

13:08.430 --> 13:09.270
I'll just tell him

13:09.430 --> 13:11.711
that my boyfriend is the jealous type.

13:11.791 --> 13:12.831
It's hard to please him.

13:12.991 --> 13:14.190
I'll let him talk to you.

13:16.791 --> 13:17.791
That's more like it.

13:18.470 --> 13:19.470
Oh, by the way,

13:20.070 --> 13:21.991
respond to Jiang Yu that way too.

13:23.310 --> 13:24.350
No problem.

13:50.991 --> 13:52.110
Hello, Lucy.

13:52.511 --> 13:53.190
What's up?

13:53.350 --> 13:54.350
Turn on the speaker.

13:54.791 --> 13:56.390
Help, I can barely breathe.

13:56.671 --> 13:58.350
What's wrong?
Is your clothing too tight?

13:59.230 --> 14:00.230
No.

14:02.831 --> 14:03.831
It's my girlfriend.

14:04.911 --> 14:05.911
She just confessed to me.

14:06.511 --> 14:07.591
Girlfriend?

14:08.470 --> 14:09.911
You two are back together?

14:10.871 --> 14:12.631
Good for you.

14:13.430 --> 14:14.671
Without me

14:15.791 --> 14:17.150
and Cai Yingying,

14:17.791 --> 14:18.791
you'll never

14:18.991 --> 14:20.911
win back Xu Zhi.

14:20.991 --> 14:21.991
You bad boy.

14:22.871 --> 14:24.190
Why don't you scold me again?

14:24.991 --> 14:26.791
I even feel it's a bit unreal.

14:28.751 --> 14:29.190
Alright.

14:29.551 --> 14:30.911
I'm telling you, be serious.

14:30.991 --> 14:32.711
Pay me for the taxi later.

14:33.030 --> 14:34.911
We're stuck and haven't gone home yet.

14:35.551 --> 14:36.311
I'm speechless.

14:36.391 --> 14:37.591
I thought

14:37.671 --> 14:38.591
you are popular,

14:38.671 --> 14:40.791
but you need me
to help you pursue a girl. You loser.

14:40.871 --> 14:42.672
- And thank me.
- You also owe Yingying.

14:42.752 --> 14:43.871
Okay.

14:44.430 --> 14:45.430
Send me the bill.

14:45.911 --> 14:46.511
I have to go.

14:46.671 --> 14:48.230
- Okay, bye.
- Bye.

14:50.070 --> 14:51.230
Finally.

14:54.390 --> 14:55.390
It's too late.

14:58.802 --> 15:01.144
(Gaoxing Art Training School)

15:01.511 --> 15:03.350
Oh no, we can't get in.

15:06.591 --> 15:07.791
Is there a back door?

15:08.030 --> 15:08.591
Yes.

15:08.671 --> 15:09.230
Where is it?

15:09.430 --> 15:10.430
Over there.

15:10.671 --> 15:11.671
Let's go.

15:12.110 --> 15:13.110
Let's go.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.390
It's here.

15:20.470 --> 15:21.470
Take off your jacket.

15:27.671 --> 15:28.671
What are you doing?

15:31.030 --> 15:31.632
Come on.

15:31.712 --> 15:32.751
Don't let your teacher

15:32.831 --> 15:33.511
see it.

15:33.591 --> 15:34.950
Are you kidding me?

15:35.030 --> 15:36.511
Weren't you just saying I was heavy?

15:37.030 --> 15:38.791
I'm strong enough to hold you.

15:38.871 --> 15:39.871
Come on.

15:40.871 --> 15:41.351
Well,

15:41.431 --> 15:42.431
I'm doing it.

15:42.511 --> 15:43.511
Go ahead.

15:45.310 --> 15:46.551
Step on it.

15:46.911 --> 15:47.911
Use your strength.

15:50.030 --> 15:51.030
Go.

15:51.110 --> 15:51.950
Don't look.

15:52.030 --> 15:53.030
I won't look.

15:53.190 --> 15:54.190
So high.

15:54.350 --> 15:55.871
Put your foot over first.

16:02.751 --> 16:03.390
Done.

16:03.631 --> 16:04.390
Are you okay?

16:04.470 --> 16:05.470
I'm fine.

16:05.831 --> 16:06.831
Wait a moment.

16:07.591 --> 16:08.591
Catch it.

16:11.551 --> 16:12.551
Your bag.

16:17.831 --> 16:18.831
Here's the jacket.

16:19.831 --> 16:21.310
Put it on in case you get cold.

16:23.030 --> 16:23.671
Okay.

16:24.030 --> 16:25.310
I have to go.

16:25.871 --> 16:27.470
Good night.

16:27.871 --> 16:29.671
Alright, you too.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.511
(You're too thin.)

16:44.871 --> 16:46.511
(Be sure to eat more now.)

16:46.791 --> 16:48.551
(Keep healthy for your exam.)

16:49.511 --> 16:50.511
(I'm leaving.)

16:50.591 --> 16:51.591
(Good night.)

16:54.430 --> 16:56.310
(You also have to eat well.)

16:56.470 --> 16:58.070
(After all, you're Stylish Zhu.)

16:58.150 --> 16:59.230
(Do not diet.)

17:31.030 --> 17:33.911
On the first day of dating, are you going
to scare your boyfriend away?

17:35.751 --> 17:36.751
Eat in small bites.

17:37.030 --> 17:37.990
Don't choke on it.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.070
Here.

17:46.671 --> 17:48.671
Xu Gongzhu and others
want to treat you to a meal.

17:52.150 --> 17:54.070
They will thank you for the drone.

17:55.911 --> 17:56.911
Forget it.

17:57.150 --> 17:59.350
Last birthday, they almost beat me.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.390
Were you scared?

18:04.551 --> 18:05.551
Sure.

18:09.350 --> 18:10.631
Why didn't you wear them before?

18:14.951 --> 18:16.110
You know why.

18:17.591 --> 18:19.190
Will you take them off?

18:19.270 --> 18:20.430
It depends on how you behave.

18:21.230 --> 18:22.230
Okay.

18:22.671 --> 18:24.470
You wait and see.

18:29.190 --> 18:30.711
Going to the library later?

18:32.511 --> 18:33.791
I've been busy with calculus.

18:33.871 --> 18:35.110
Other subjects are left behind.

18:37.230 --> 18:38.270
Li Ke urged me again.

18:39.070 --> 18:40.070
Look.

18:40.671 --> 18:41.671
What time is it already?

18:44.150 --> 18:45.791
Your major is really competitive.

18:48.190 --> 18:50.270
The papers in College Entrance Exam
weren't the same.

18:50.270 --> 18:52.711
The top students from different places
don't see eye to eye.

18:53.430 --> 18:55.350
Now it's midterms,
and the papers are unified.

18:55.871 --> 18:57.431
Everyone wants to see their level

18:57.511 --> 18:58.511
and compete.

18:59.991 --> 19:01.270
Go to the library with me later.

19:02.551 --> 19:03.591
Then we need to hurry.

19:03.591 --> 19:06.136
It's hard to secure a spot
when the top students are around.

19:10.871 --> 19:11.871
Here.

19:27.190 --> 19:28.390
How come

19:28.871 --> 19:30.511
you two came together?

19:32.310 --> 19:33.310
Tell me.

19:33.390 --> 19:34.591
Where did you stay last night?

19:35.310 --> 19:36.470
Let me tell you.

19:36.551 --> 19:38.511
You haven't returned to the dorm
for two nights.

19:38.591 --> 19:40.270
The dorms nearby have known it.

19:40.791 --> 19:41.791
Really?

19:42.551 --> 19:43.711
I guess

19:43.791 --> 19:45.671
Zhao Tianqi and you got this out.

19:46.030 --> 19:47.791
That's why there are so many gossips.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.831
I didn't get this out.

19:49.911 --> 19:51.070
Am I that kind of person?

19:52.230 --> 19:53.711
Zhao Tianqi did it.

19:54.551 --> 19:55.551
Okay.

19:56.310 --> 19:57.310
Zhu Yangqi is here.

19:57.310 --> 19:59.416
I have stayed with him
in a hotel for two days.

20:05.671 --> 20:06.831
I barely believe it.

20:10.991 --> 20:11.991
Be careful.

20:12.911 --> 20:13.990
I have only one girlfriend.

20:14.070 --> 20:15.070
Don't get hurt.

20:15.831 --> 20:16.831
Let it cool for a while.

20:17.551 --> 20:19.190
So, how many girlfriends do you want?

20:20.871 --> 20:21.350
What?

20:21.671 --> 20:22.991
You two

20:24.751 --> 20:25.751
are together, right?

20:28.270 --> 20:29.270
She's pretty clingy.

20:29.751 --> 20:31.470
She insisted on coming here with me.

20:37.831 --> 20:39.150
I hate being a third wheel.

20:39.551 --> 20:40.551
Wait. Chen Luzhou.

20:40.911 --> 20:41.911
Look at you.

20:41.991 --> 20:43.591
You are bragging.

20:46.551 --> 20:47.311
Sit down.

20:47.391 --> 20:48.871
Can you find another seat?

20:56.230 --> 20:58.591
What an amazing girl!

20:58.671 --> 20:59.791
Look at her mindset.

21:00.070 --> 21:01.110
She's so calm.

21:01.270 --> 21:02.390
Much better than you.

21:04.911 --> 21:06.310
Am I the first one to know?

21:08.831 --> 21:09.831
No.

21:10.631 --> 21:11.631
The second one.

21:12.190 --> 21:13.111
I called Zhu Yangqi

21:13.191 --> 21:14.631
when we confirmed our relationship.

21:16.591 --> 21:17.591
You're the third one.

21:18.430 --> 21:19.911
Cai Yingying was with him.

21:24.230 --> 21:25.230
Something's not right.

21:26.390 --> 21:28.511
Weren't you staying with Zhu Yangqi

21:28.591 --> 21:30.150
in the same hotel?

21:30.551 --> 21:31.991
Did you need to call him?

21:32.711 --> 21:34.110
I have a lot of phone credit.

21:34.470 --> 21:35.470
Is that not okay?

21:39.751 --> 21:40.751
Okay.

21:43.430 --> 21:44.711
But I must remind you.

21:44.711 --> 21:46.390
It's not easy to graduate from Huaguang.

21:47.030 --> 21:49.030
Zhang Yuan from Hedong Province
asked me yesterday

21:49.030 --> 21:50.951
about your math score
in College Entrance Examination.

21:50.951 --> 21:54.350
He knows you won first prize
in national math and science contest.

21:54.591 --> 21:56.030
He is watching you.

21:58.150 --> 21:59.350
Stop worrying about it.

22:00.671 --> 22:02.030
I have an excellent girlfriend.

22:02.711 --> 22:03.711
Can I fall behind?

22:08.711 --> 22:09.791
I think I know

22:10.030 --> 22:11.871
how Xu Zhi won you over.

22:14.871 --> 22:18.511
She's an agreeable girl, after all.

22:43.951 --> 22:44.350
Good.

22:44.430 --> 22:45.430
Good shot.

22:45.671 --> 22:46.631
Good shot.

22:46.711 --> 22:47.711
Let's go.

22:47.871 --> 22:48.871
Bye-bye.

22:49.030 --> 22:49.631
Okay, bye.

22:49.991 --> 22:51.430
I have chocolates. Do you want them?

22:52.070 --> 22:53.070
You're not losing weight?

22:53.671 --> 22:54.951
No, I'm not.

22:55.871 --> 22:57.070
Forget it.

22:57.150 --> 22:59.350
My charm isn't affected by my weight.

22:59.591 --> 23:00.591
Come on. Pass it to me.

23:01.470 --> 23:02.030
Lucy.

23:02.190 --> 23:03.711
How about we share an apartment?

23:04.190 --> 23:06.230
I can't stand my two bizarre roommates.

23:06.511 --> 23:08.760
Our schools are far apart.
How can we share an apartment?

23:09.310 --> 23:10.911
It's okay. I'll compromise.

23:10.991 --> 23:12.390
I can live near your school.

23:12.511 --> 23:14.991
I don't have many classes.
It's convenient to play basketball.

23:15.310 --> 23:17.030
Have you thought if it's okay for me?

23:21.190 --> 23:22.551
Are you thinking of Zhi?

23:25.350 --> 23:26.350
It's fine.

23:26.591 --> 23:27.791
I can live with you two.

23:28.430 --> 23:29.430
There's no problem.

23:30.070 --> 23:31.871
Buddy, you're really straightforward.

23:31.951 --> 23:32.911
Forget it.

23:32.991 --> 23:34.591
I'll change my major in the second year.

23:34.791 --> 23:36.390
I have a lot of courses to catch up on.

23:36.951 --> 23:38.310
Living at school will be better.

23:39.110 --> 23:41.190
Don't you think about me?

23:41.470 --> 23:43.110
Commuting is allowed in the second year.

23:43.310 --> 23:44.871
Then Ke and I will move out.

23:45.390 --> 23:46.470
And he'll start a business.

23:46.591 --> 23:47.591
You can live with us.

23:47.991 --> 23:48.911
What do you think?

23:48.991 --> 23:50.950
You're in our future plans.

23:51.030 --> 23:52.310
Just be patient.

23:53.991 --> 23:55.150
You said

23:55.230 --> 23:57.991
I would have Tony, Andy, and Nancy.

23:58.190 --> 23:59.431
You're the playboy, okay?

23:59.511 --> 24:00.991
You have Zhi and Ke.

24:01.230 --> 24:02.951
Look, you can't say things like that.

24:03.110 --> 24:04.871
I can't compare with Xu Zhi.

24:06.951 --> 24:07.990
Guess what score Zhi got

24:08.070 --> 24:09.470
on the midterm calculus exam?

24:09.791 --> 24:10.791
Perfect score.

24:10.951 --> 24:12.711
She's the only one in the whole grade.

24:13.871 --> 24:15.350
That's pretty impressive.

24:15.631 --> 24:17.310
But Lucy can do better

24:17.831 --> 24:18.672
than her.

24:18.752 --> 24:19.791
Getting a perfect score

24:20.030 --> 24:21.190
is a piece of cake for him.

24:21.511 --> 24:22.591
You think too highly

24:23.070 --> 24:24.150
of him.

24:24.270 --> 24:25.511
He only scored 96, okay?

24:29.551 --> 24:31.430
Are you not attractive enough?

24:31.631 --> 24:33.831
Xu Zhi isn't much affected by dating.

24:34.070 --> 24:35.070
Your energy got worse

24:35.150 --> 24:36.511
than before.

24:37.150 --> 24:38.430
What makes you say that?

24:39.991 --> 24:41.350
Just tell me.

24:41.430 --> 24:42.711
I got one point in the end.

24:43.871 --> 24:44.991
Did you two score today?

24:45.230 --> 24:45.751
Alright.

24:45.831 --> 24:46.631
Alright.

24:46.791 --> 24:47.632
Moreover,

24:47.712 --> 24:49.270
Zhi is an amazing girl from Qingyi.

24:52.711 --> 24:53.390
He is hopeless.

24:53.551 --> 24:54.551
I can't stand him.

24:56.791 --> 24:57.791
Let's go.

24:59.751 --> 25:00.791
Hold on.

25:01.430 --> 25:02.430
Here you go.

25:04.831 --> 25:06.136
Will you come this weekend?

25:07.030 --> 25:08.110
Will you come this weekend?

25:08.470 --> 25:09.911
Why? Be the third wheel again?

25:10.711 --> 25:13.591
I haven't bought you dinner
since Zhi and I were in a relationship.

25:13.911 --> 25:15.751
So, come for dinner if you're free

25:15.871 --> 25:16.432
this weekend.

25:16.512 --> 25:17.951
We'll celebrate my birthday.

25:18.711 --> 25:20.150
Aren't you two doing it alone?

25:21.150 --> 25:24.150
If I celebrate my birthday in a
relationship after being single for long,

25:24.310 --> 25:26.270
I'll let my girlfriend
get a big surprise for me.

25:26.350 --> 25:26.791
Right?

25:26.871 --> 25:27.831
Yeah.

25:27.911 --> 25:28.911
Forget it.

25:29.350 --> 25:30.591
I can't bother my girlfriend.

25:30.911 --> 25:31.911
She is busy with drawing.

25:32.230 --> 25:33.671
Preparing a surprise will be tiring.

25:35.430 --> 25:36.950
Hey, you are so picky.

25:37.030 --> 25:37.712
Cut it out.

25:37.792 --> 25:39.470
You love ritual, don't you?

25:41.190 --> 25:43.270
The point is,
Zhi's major is mentally draining.

25:43.511 --> 25:45.190
Those seniors in her major even joked

25:45.270 --> 25:46.151
that they can only

25:46.231 --> 25:48.791
contribute to the nation
for five to ten years at most.

25:48.911 --> 25:50.070
So far, how many times

25:50.350 --> 25:52.390
has she stayed up
and how much coffee has she drunk?

25:53.230 --> 25:54.751
In short, come over when you're free.

25:54.831 --> 25:55.190
Okay?

25:55.270 --> 25:55.950
Make my birthday

25:56.030 --> 25:57.030
simple.

25:57.871 --> 25:59.470
Are you that considerate?

26:00.230 --> 26:01.270
Then let's date.

26:01.831 --> 26:02.591
Guess what?

26:02.671 --> 26:04.591
The three of us work hard
to live a better life.

26:04.671 --> 26:05.231
I'll join you.

26:05.311 --> 26:06.990
The four of us go for it.

26:07.070 --> 26:07.871
Go for it!

26:07.951 --> 26:08.871
- Right?
- Get lost.

26:08.951 --> 26:09.951
What do you say?

26:10.390 --> 26:11.390
- Buddy.
- Get lost.

26:19.350 --> 26:21.270
Your lunch has arrived.

26:22.671 --> 26:24.591
Two sandwiches. You're welcome.

26:24.751 --> 26:25.698
Look.

26:25.778 --> 26:27.350
(College Mathematics, Total Score, 100)

26:27.350 --> 26:28.350
I already know.

26:30.310 --> 26:31.871
Very impressive.

26:31.951 --> 26:32.951
I lost to you.

26:33.150 --> 26:35.791
Let me think about how to punish you.

26:36.711 --> 26:37.711
Think about it.

26:47.470 --> 26:48.470
Speaking.

26:48.671 --> 26:49.791
I'm in Beijing now.

26:50.030 --> 26:51.511
I'm at the Tianjie Center.

26:52.190 --> 26:53.190
Come to see me right now.

26:53.871 --> 26:55.030
Are you kidding me?

26:55.591 --> 26:56.591
I have to go.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.470
So, did you miss me?

27:13.551 --> 27:14.871
Chen Xingqi, are you serious?

27:16.190 --> 27:17.190
What happened?

27:22.350 --> 27:23.350
Chen Xingqi.

27:24.991 --> 27:26.190
You finally came.

27:26.390 --> 27:27.430
You dyed your hair?

27:27.671 --> 27:28.671
Why did you do that?

27:29.671 --> 27:31.230
I did it to anger our dad.

27:31.551 --> 27:33.551
Did anyone mistake you
for a traffic light?

27:33.871 --> 27:35.591
Speaking of which,
I remembered something.

27:36.150 --> 27:37.390
When Dad was driving yesterday,

27:37.511 --> 27:38.310
he almost hit me.

27:38.470 --> 27:41.390
- He mistook me for a green light?
- I think he purposely wanted to hit you.

27:42.190 --> 27:43.190
Who cares?

27:43.951 --> 27:45.751
Anyway, I'm his only son now.

27:46.070 --> 27:46.671
If I'm dead,

27:46.991 --> 27:48.150
who will take care of him?

27:49.390 --> 27:50.591
Why did you come here?

27:52.791 --> 27:54.390
I just missed you.

27:54.631 --> 27:55.631
Cut it out.

27:56.190 --> 27:57.230
I missed you too.

27:57.390 --> 27:58.390
Cut it out.

28:00.631 --> 28:01.631
Luzhou,

28:03.150 --> 28:04.190
I'm starving.

28:04.270 --> 28:04.871
Come on.

28:05.230 --> 28:05.951
I need food.

28:06.031 --> 28:07.190
Take me to eat something.

28:08.310 --> 28:09.310
Come on.

28:09.390 --> 28:10.390
Stop it.

28:10.711 --> 28:11.551
Take your stuff

28:11.711 --> 28:12.150
yourself.

28:12.230 --> 28:13.190
Okay.

28:13.270 --> 28:14.270
Come on.

28:18.871 --> 28:20.751
I want this, this,

28:21.310 --> 28:22.310
and this.

28:22.831 --> 28:24.390
Taro ball dessert without peanuts.

28:24.671 --> 28:26.070
My brother is allergic to them.

28:26.591 --> 28:27.591
What food you can't eat?

28:27.951 --> 28:28.951
No dietary restrictions.

28:29.470 --> 28:30.591
Alright then, thank you.

28:30.911 --> 28:31.911
Okay.

28:33.511 --> 28:34.511
Tell me.

28:34.671 --> 28:35.671
Why are you here?

28:40.831 --> 28:41.831
Come out.

28:43.110 --> 28:44.230
Starting today,

28:44.470 --> 28:46.110
I'm officially running away from home.

28:46.911 --> 28:48.711
I can't leave this little turtle

28:48.791 --> 28:49.552
to Chen Jishen.

28:49.632 --> 28:51.511
From now on, you have it.

28:52.190 --> 28:53.190
Treat it well.

28:53.551 --> 28:56.310
Feed the turtle three times a week.

28:56.390 --> 28:57.511
I'll take you back later.

28:58.751 --> 28:59.751
What are you doing?

28:59.911 --> 29:00.911
Booking a ticket.

29:01.951 --> 29:02.951
Give it to me.

29:03.831 --> 29:04.831
Sit down.

29:09.150 --> 29:10.150
Can I

29:10.310 --> 29:11.470
be with you?

29:12.470 --> 29:13.270
What?

29:13.390 --> 29:14.270
I'm already broke.

29:14.350 --> 29:15.350
How can I support you?

29:15.791 --> 29:16.791
I'm easy to support.

29:17.390 --> 29:18.511
Just give me food to eat.

29:20.030 --> 29:21.030
If it doesn't work,

29:21.230 --> 29:22.871
I can work and earn money.

29:26.591 --> 29:27.671
Did Chen Jishen hit you?

29:29.951 --> 29:31.070
After Mom moved out,

29:32.711 --> 29:34.030
she never came to see me again.

29:38.110 --> 29:39.591
Chen Jishen and I argued

29:40.390 --> 29:41.671
every time we met.

29:43.871 --> 29:45.030
He rarely came home

29:47.390 --> 29:48.831
or scolded me at home.

29:50.110 --> 29:50.512
Anyway,

29:50.592 --> 29:51.711
I will never go back.

29:59.751 --> 30:00.751
Listen to me.

30:00.991 --> 30:02.070
Go back and go to school.

30:02.591 --> 30:04.110
I'll see you when I'm free, okay?

30:04.430 --> 30:05.430
You're lying.

30:05.591 --> 30:06.991
You and Mom don't want me.

30:20.110 --> 30:21.110
Mom.

30:21.350 --> 30:22.350
Put your brother on.

30:30.511 --> 30:31.150
Mom.

30:31.270 --> 30:32.230
Chen Xingqi.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.390
I can't believe you.

30:33.631 --> 30:34.751
You actually bought a ticket

30:34.831 --> 30:35.911
on my phone and ran away.

30:36.070 --> 30:37.070
What if you get lost?

30:37.150 --> 30:38.470
It's none of your business.

30:38.911 --> 30:39.911
Chen Xingqi.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.110
Lower your voice.

30:42.190 --> 30:43.190
Behave.

30:43.270 --> 30:44.350
I'll be there soon.

30:49.551 --> 30:51.150
(Luzhou, we will talk privately)

30:51.230 --> 30:52.230
(later.)

30:53.791 --> 30:54.791
Zhi.

30:55.350 --> 30:56.350
Help me watch him.

30:57.390 --> 30:58.390
Which one?

30:59.230 --> 31:00.230
Both of them.

31:02.551 --> 31:03.350
You stay.

31:03.430 --> 31:04.430
Where are you going?

31:04.871 --> 31:05.871
To pick up my mom.

31:17.551 --> 31:18.551
Zhi.

31:18.631 --> 31:20.511
When did you
and my brother get together?

31:21.230 --> 31:22.751
Kids don't ask about adult matters.

31:23.350 --> 31:24.671
What stage are you at now?

31:25.110 --> 31:26.110
At least,

31:26.230 --> 31:27.671
you've held hands, right?

31:28.190 --> 31:29.631
How's Qian doing lately?

31:31.791 --> 31:34.190
She won an award
in a tennis match last week.

31:34.390 --> 31:36.551
In this week's English speech game,

31:37.110 --> 31:37.950
she won first place.

31:38.030 --> 31:39.030
She's really amazing.

31:39.551 --> 31:40.831
Then you should learn from her.

31:40.911 --> 31:42.470
Put more effort into your studies,

31:42.591 --> 31:44.270
and stop meddling in adult matters.

31:44.911 --> 31:46.390
You haven't married my brother yet.

31:46.671 --> 31:47.350
What?

31:47.430 --> 31:48.711
Lecturing me now?

31:48.791 --> 31:50.310
Why do you meddle in my business?

31:51.350 --> 31:52.751
Can't I?

32:27.150 --> 32:28.150
Where's your brother?

32:28.671 --> 32:29.671
He's with Xu Zhi.

32:32.150 --> 32:33.230
You and Xu Zhi...

32:33.310 --> 32:34.310
We're good.

32:40.511 --> 32:41.511
Well,

32:44.270 --> 32:45.230
during summer vacation,

32:45.310 --> 32:46.350
I went to see her.

32:47.150 --> 32:48.150
I know.

32:55.511 --> 32:56.591
If I cause trouble

32:59.150 --> 33:00.511
for you

33:00.591 --> 33:01.671
and her,

33:03.270 --> 33:04.270
sorry about that.

33:05.030 --> 33:06.230
What do you plan to do next?

33:08.390 --> 33:11.751
Bring Chen Xingqi back to Qingyi
and hand him over to Chen Jishen?

33:14.110 --> 33:15.511
Actually, I have no choice.

33:16.070 --> 33:17.591
That's how the court ruled.

33:17.751 --> 33:19.070
Sure, that's how the court ruled.

33:20.270 --> 33:21.951
What if the court awards him to you?

33:23.591 --> 33:24.791
Will you abandon him too?

33:30.551 --> 33:32.230
You've already abandoned me once.

33:37.991 --> 33:39.110
The offer has arrived.

33:39.430 --> 33:40.911
Yet you gave it up.

33:41.631 --> 33:43.310
No further discussion.

33:43.711 --> 33:44.951
Don't I get a say

33:45.470 --> 33:47.430
on Luzhou's matter?

33:47.951 --> 33:49.591
Just because of an accident?

33:50.951 --> 33:53.390
I'm Luzhou's biological mother.

33:53.991 --> 33:55.791
I have already abandoned him once.

33:56.951 --> 33:58.631
I won't abandon him again.

34:10.751 --> 34:11.672
If I knew

34:11.752 --> 34:13.310
he sent you to the orphanage,

34:14.751 --> 34:17.350
I'd never have handed you over to him.

34:18.791 --> 34:19.791
You mean...

34:20.711 --> 34:21.951
Your biological father.

34:25.591 --> 34:26.591
Don't be afraid.

34:32.831 --> 34:33.831
Don't be afraid, Luzhou.

34:34.911 --> 34:35.911
Call her mom.

34:38.744 --> 34:40.030
(Nursing Department)
Call her mom.

34:46.390 --> 34:47.390
Mom.

35:17.591 --> 35:19.551
At that time, I had no work.

35:19.631 --> 35:21.791
I had to look for a job while pregnant.

35:22.711 --> 35:24.270
Later, I met Chen Jishen.

35:25.350 --> 35:27.030
He was pretty good to me at that time.

35:28.070 --> 35:28.991
The more important is

35:29.071 --> 35:31.070
that he could accept you.

35:32.470 --> 35:33.470
I thought

35:35.030 --> 35:36.230
that was not bad.

35:37.110 --> 35:38.711
At least I could give you a home.

35:42.511 --> 35:44.030
Later, your biological father

35:44.631 --> 35:45.631
somehow...

35:45.791 --> 35:46.751
Well,

35:46.831 --> 35:48.430
he went to Chen Jishen's company

35:49.150 --> 35:49.951
and made a scene.

35:50.031 --> 35:51.591
It was very unbearable.

35:52.711 --> 35:53.990
He scolded me.

35:54.070 --> 35:56.310
He asked me to hand you over to him.

35:56.390 --> 35:57.511
He said he couldn't

35:57.711 --> 35:58.592
let another man

35:58.672 --> 35:59.991
raise his own son.

36:04.991 --> 36:05.991
Well,

36:06.551 --> 36:08.030
why did he abandon me later on?

36:11.390 --> 36:13.110
He was reckless when he was young.

36:15.470 --> 36:18.551
He relied on his driving skills
to race everywhere.

36:19.416 --> 36:21.624
One day, he had a car accident
and went into a coma.

36:23.591 --> 36:27.350
His mom was mentally sick.

36:29.430 --> 36:30.991
She sent you to an orphanage.

36:33.230 --> 36:34.390
After he woke up,

36:34.470 --> 36:36.430
he suddenly remembered he had a son.

36:38.631 --> 36:40.711
But he forgot what you looked like.

36:42.711 --> 36:44.951
When he was desperate, he came to me.

36:45.150 --> 36:46.751
He asked me to find you
at the orphanage.

36:47.270 --> 36:48.751
I was going crazy.

36:49.110 --> 36:50.350
I couldn't hand you

36:50.511 --> 36:51.511
over to him anymore.

36:53.350 --> 36:54.591
So, I lied to him

36:55.551 --> 36:57.711
about you being adopted by someone else.

36:59.190 --> 37:00.230
At that time,

37:01.430 --> 37:03.190
Chen Xingqi suddenly fell ill.

37:03.390 --> 37:04.430
He had a persistent fever.

37:05.711 --> 37:06.711
You know,

37:07.190 --> 37:08.951
Chen Jishen is very superstitious.

37:09.711 --> 37:10.991
I found a fortune-teller

37:11.751 --> 37:12.751
and let him say

37:13.190 --> 37:15.390
Chen Xingqi must have an elder brother.

37:15.951 --> 37:16.951
So,

37:17.951 --> 37:19.190
you took that chance

37:19.430 --> 37:20.591
to take me to his home?

37:23.551 --> 37:24.551
Right.

37:28.671 --> 37:30.390
Does Chen Jishen know my identity?

37:35.430 --> 37:36.430
Lian Hui.

37:37.230 --> 37:38.711
I'm here, honey.

37:40.070 --> 37:41.070
You're back.

37:45.461 --> 37:47.310
(DNA Test Report)

37:47.390 --> 37:49.070
You've been tricking me from the start,

37:49.270 --> 37:50.390
haven't you?

37:51.190 --> 37:52.911
Take a look yourself.

38:02.965 --> 38:07.032
(Lian Hui is
Chen Luzhou's birth mother.)

38:13.470 --> 38:14.470
Jishen.

38:16.470 --> 38:17.831
Jishen, I'm sorry.

38:18.230 --> 38:19.511
I made a mistake.

38:20.030 --> 38:21.911
Don't involve the child in this matter.

38:21.991 --> 38:22.711
Please.

38:22.791 --> 38:23.791
Let go.

38:29.831 --> 38:30.831
I'm sorry.

38:32.470 --> 38:34.631
I'm really sorry. I deceived you.

38:35.430 --> 38:36.511
But Luzhou is still young.

38:36.591 --> 38:37.791
He doesn't know anything.

38:38.551 --> 38:39.831
Will you forgive me?

38:42.511 --> 38:44.350
Forgive me. I'm sorry.

39:00.511 --> 39:02.230
When he turns 18,

39:05.470 --> 39:06.791
send him abroad.

39:10.831 --> 39:12.390
Okay.

39:13.350 --> 39:14.350
As you wish.

39:17.270 --> 39:18.430
So, you said

39:19.991 --> 39:21.871
even if he agreed
to not let me go abroad,

39:21.951 --> 39:23.070
you wouldn't agree.

39:25.110 --> 39:26.711
Is it because you feel indebted to him?

39:27.230 --> 39:29.751
Even if your dad changes his mind,
I won't agree.

39:33.310 --> 39:35.150
You asked me not to anger him

39:36.551 --> 39:42.470
and behave because you were afraid
he'd send me back to the orphanage.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.991
Do you want to be with me forever?

39:46.591 --> 39:47.271
You must

39:47.351 --> 39:49.430
listen to Grandma and Dad.

39:50.751 --> 39:51.751
Got it?

40:04.430 --> 40:05.430
Let's go.

40:07.751 --> 40:09.070
Don't keep Chen Xingqi waiting.

40:12.070 --> 40:13.070
Luzhou.

40:20.911 --> 40:21.991
I'm sorry.

40:24.070 --> 40:25.350
It's all my fault.

40:26.551 --> 40:27.831
Can you forgive me?

40:35.190 --> 40:36.671
Forgive me, okay?

40:38.310 --> 40:40.070
I know what you've been through.

40:43.751 --> 40:45.070
It's all my fault.

41:02.791 --> 41:04.991
You ask your brother when he'll be back.

41:06.230 --> 41:07.390
Why don't you ask yourself?

41:08.470 --> 41:10.871
When I send him a message,

41:11.150 --> 41:12.831
he never replies after reading it.

41:13.270 --> 41:14.470
But if you send him a message,

41:14.751 --> 41:15.791
he will reply instantly.

41:16.110 --> 41:17.110
Are you sure?

41:18.991 --> 41:19.991
Try it.

41:21.310 --> 41:22.310
You ask.

41:22.390 --> 41:23.390
You ask.

41:32.631 --> 41:35.150
You know
he's not my biological brother, right?

41:39.070 --> 41:41.430
One time on Children's Day,

41:43.591 --> 41:44.831
my parents decided on a whim

41:44.911 --> 41:46.511
to take me to Linshi for a day.

41:47.270 --> 41:49.551
My brother didn't have the key that day.

41:50.110 --> 41:51.470
So, when he went back,

41:51.991 --> 41:53.511
he couldn't get the door open.

41:56.871 --> 41:58.511
He didn't even call my parents.

42:00.150 --> 42:01.990
He just slept on a bench

42:02.070 --> 42:03.070
in a nearby park.

42:06.511 --> 42:08.270
When we found him the next day,

42:10.110 --> 42:12.110
my mom was so worried
that she almost cried.

42:12.991 --> 42:17.551
Yet he nonchalantly said,
"It doesn't matter where I sleep."

42:18.110 --> 42:19.390
"Why make a fuss?"

42:21.751 --> 42:23.270
Don't be so upset.

42:26.551 --> 42:27.671
I've always felt

42:29.390 --> 42:30.591
my brother never saw my home

42:30.671 --> 42:31.671
as his own home.

42:34.350 --> 42:36.430
Maybe it's because he was adopted.

42:37.831 --> 42:39.951
He seems amiable with everyone.

42:41.831 --> 42:42.871
Actually,

42:43.711 --> 42:44.911
he's not close with anyone.

42:49.831 --> 42:50.831
However,

42:50.991 --> 42:52.871
he treats you differently.

42:54.871 --> 42:57.350
He really likes you.

43:02.911 --> 43:04.751
Please keep what I just said a secret.

43:04.831 --> 43:05.831
Thank you.

43:13.150 --> 43:14.150
Hello, Ms. Lian.

43:16.470 --> 43:17.470
Chen Xingqi.

43:17.711 --> 43:19.390
How bold you are!

43:19.671 --> 43:21.230
How dare you come here alone?

43:22.030 --> 43:23.310
Are you trying to freak me out?

43:23.671 --> 43:25.150
Do you know how worried I am?

43:29.310 --> 43:30.310
Alright.

43:30.390 --> 43:32.310
Luzhou, wait for me outside
with the luggage.

43:34.270 --> 43:35.591
I want to talk to Xu Zhi.

43:39.911 --> 43:41.350
Come on. Move now.

43:48.951 --> 43:50.030
Just wait for me outside.

43:50.551 --> 43:51.551
Please have a seat.

43:59.390 --> 44:01.591
Mom isn't trying to break you two up,
is she?

44:02.030 --> 44:03.150
I absolutely disagree.

44:03.951 --> 44:05.310
You stay out of this.

44:12.551 --> 44:14.070
Let me friend you on WeChat.

44:14.230 --> 44:14.671
Okay.

44:14.991 --> 44:16.831
Let's keep in touch,

44:17.030 --> 44:17.470
alright?

44:17.631 --> 44:18.631
I'll scan your code.

44:18.751 --> 44:19.751
Here.

44:24.991 --> 44:26.070
I have to go.

44:30.631 --> 44:31.631
I'll see you off.

44:38.551 --> 44:40.991
Xingqi and I will go back to Qingyi.

44:42.511 --> 44:43.991
Take good care of yourself.

44:45.030 --> 44:46.030
Don't stay up too late.

44:46.270 --> 44:47.270
Take care.

44:47.390 --> 44:48.230
Ms. Mei is away,

44:48.350 --> 44:49.350
but you need to eat well.

44:50.232 --> 44:51.591
Don't get a stomachache again.

44:53.030 --> 44:54.030
Don't worry.

44:54.390 --> 44:55.511
The company cafeteria

44:55.911 --> 44:56.911
provides quite good food.

45:01.070 --> 45:02.070
Let's go.

45:06.030 --> 45:07.030
Give me the suitcase.

45:09.951 --> 45:10.951
We're leaving.

45:16.911 --> 45:17.592
Bye, Ms. Lian.

45:17.672 --> 45:18.751
Alright, bye.

45:19.551 --> 45:20.551
Bye-bye.

45:29.911 --> 45:30.911
What did you talk about?

45:31.871 --> 45:32.951
I told her

45:33.350 --> 45:36.150
I was pregnant with your child
and she had to get a check ready.

45:52.390 --> 45:53.390
What's wrong?

45:55.551 --> 45:56.551
Nothing.

45:57.110 --> 45:57.791
I want to hug you

45:58.070 --> 45:59.070
to give myself a break.

46:30.578 --> 46:34.008
(If there were only one last rose
in the world,)

46:34.322 --> 46:37.048
(I would rush forward
and grab it for you)

46:37.234 --> 46:43.864
(even if I were aged 80
and in a wheelchair.)

46:44.665 --> 46:50.481
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

46:51.033 --> 46:56.561
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

46:58.073 --> 47:02.521
♪The world is too quiet♪

47:03.513 --> 47:10.441
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

47:11.353 --> 47:16.441
♪Who will visit me♪

47:17.497 --> 47:23.121
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

47:23.865 --> 47:26.921
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

47:27.161 --> 47:32.481
♪Into concern and care♪

47:38.009 --> 47:43.121
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

47:43.641 --> 47:49.481
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

47:50.937 --> 47:54.321
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

47:54.457 --> 48:00.681
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:01.177 --> 48:04.121
♪The lonely clock♪

48:04.281 --> 48:08.881
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

48:09.273 --> 48:12.521
♪Are we both♪

48:12.793 --> 48:16.321
♪Attracted to each other♪

48:17.465 --> 48:24.081
♪Falling into you♪

48:27.801 --> 48:33.601
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:34.457 --> 48:37.121
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

48:37.657 --> 48:42.281
♪From reaching eternity♪

48:42.681 --> 48:45.961
♪After rushing recklessly♪

48:46.169 --> 48:49.601
♪We approach each other♪

48:50.873 --> 48:54.481
♪Without turning back♪

48:55.865 --> 49:03.521
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

49:04.153 --> 49:10.641
♪Falling into you♪
